      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    nominal_return = 0.08\n    tax_rate = 0.20\n    inflation_rate = 0.025\n\n    # Calculate the after-tax nominal return\n    after_tax_return = nominal_return * (1 - tax_rate)\n\n    # Adjust for inflation to calculate the real return\n    after_tax_real_return = (1 + after_tax_return) / (1 + inflation_rate) - 1\n\n    # Convert to a percentage rounded to two decimal places\n    answer = round(after_tax_real_return * 100, 2)\n\n    # Return the answer\n    return answer\n```",
